00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Three AGV dispatch strategies. One identical factory scenario.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:19,000
FIFO uses one shared lane. Queues form at Inspection: 21 predicted conflicts.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Nearest-job assigns the closest available vehicle: 15 predicted conflicts.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Zone-based dispatch gives each fleet a clear owner: 9 predicted conflicts.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Zone-based reduces predicted conflicts by 57% versus FIFO in this modeled scenario.

